{"entryId":"3155","paragraphs":[{"sourceId":"heilprin:sefaria-warsaw:ta:3155:1","sourceSha256":"788b3a9ed07972906d2ba225390704e0253fd2aa739164c00d6c4d569f57717c","englishSha256":"1673df6a11cdffead7ffe8c54ce11977d63a29354402b30b9c379c57ea239e40","citations":[{"id":"3155:1:link-001","he":[13,26],"en":[19,33],"target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Bava_Metzia_24b.8"},"reference":"Bava Metzia 24b:8","assessment":"The named chapter contains the household of bar Maryon in the dropped-meat case, giving a relevant but less explicit witness. The Bavli does not give the name Rabbah in that passage.","evidence":[{"reference":"Bava Metzia 24b:8","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Bava_Metzia_24b.8"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Rashi on Bava Metzia 24b:8:2","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Rashi_on_Bava_Metzia_24b.8.2"},"witness":"Vilna Edition"}]},{"id":"3155:1:link-002","he":[28,72],"en":[34,111],"target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Eruvin_19a.15"},"reference":"Eruvin 19a:15","assessment":"The source gives alternate chains, including the baraita taught by Rabbah. It does not place Rabbah personally in the earlier teacher’s lifetime.","evidence":[{"reference":"Eruvin 19a:15","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Eruvin_19a.15"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"}]},{"id":"3155:1:link-003","he":[73,152],"en":[112,260],"target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Rashi_on_Eruvin_19a.15.1"},"reference":"Rashi on Eruvin 19a:15:1","assessment":"Exact Rashi makes the analogy and expands Rabban. No teacher-pupil inference.","evidence":[{"reference":"Rashi on Eruvin 19a:15:1","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Rashi_on_Eruvin_19a.15.1"},"witness":"Vilna Edition"}]},{"id":"3155:1:link-004","he":[153,162],"en":[261,279],"target":{"entry":2548,"paragraph":1},"reference":"Seder HaDorot, Tanaim and Amoraim 2548:1","assessment":"The referenced entry expressly lists Rabbah bar Maryon; the preceding R. Maryon notice gives the parallel transmission as well.","evidence":[{"reference":"Seder HaDorot 2548:1","target":{"entry":2548,"paragraph":1},"witness":"Pinned Warsaw digital witness"},{"reference":"Seder HaDorot 2545:1","target":{"entry":2545,"paragraph":1},"witness":"Pinned Warsaw digital witness"}]}],"inlineHebrew":[0,1,2,3],"holds":[],"notes":[{"text":"Bava Metzia 24b gives the bar Maryon household. Eruvin 19a explicitly names Rabbah bar Maryon as transmitting a school baraita, and Rashi compares the collection with the Tosefta.","references":[],"urls":[]}],"comparisonEvidence":[]}],"entryEvidence":[]}
